span><span id=\"permission-summary\">正在核对权限…</span></div><button id=\"authorize\">GitHub 登录</button><button id=\"logout\" hidden>退出授权</button></div></header>\n<main><section class=\"intro\" hidden><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">ONE TEAM. ONE PLACE.</div><h1>让每一件事，都有着落。</h1><p>从一个想法，到一次交付。团队的进展，在这里一起发生。</p></div><div id=\"stats\" class=\"stats\"></div></section>\n<nav aria-label=\"功能区\"><button class=\"tab active\" data-view=\"board\">协作告示板 <span>01</span></button><button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"accounts\" hidden>公有账号 <span>02</span></button><button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"manage\" hidden>权限管理 <span>03</span></button><button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"accepted\">已验收 <span>04</span></button><button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"points\" hidden>积分中心 <span>05</span></button><div class=\"nav-tail\"><span class=\"live-dot\"></span><span id=\"sync-status\">连接中</span><button id=\"refresh\" title=\"刷新\">↻</button></div></nav>\n<div id=\"notice\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<p id=\"member-policy\" class=\"panel-hint\">建议组织成员可以也可以签发组织成员的永久链接。。。。但主管可以后台取消组织成员权限，自然权限和签发权限都可以后台取消</p>\n<section id=\"member-access\" class=\"management-panel\" hidden><div class=\"section-head\"><div><h2>组织成员永久链接</h2><p>成员链接不设到期时间。取消成员权限或签发权限，新旧链接及派生会话立即失效；恢复权限后须重新签发。</p></div><div class=\"section-actions\"><button id=\"member-link\" hidden>签发我的成员永久链接</button><button id=\"add-member-policy\" hidden>设置成员权限…</button></div></div><div id=\"organization-members\"></div><div id=\"member-links\"></div></section>\n<section id=\"board-view\" class=\"view\"><div class=\"toolbar\"><div class=\"filters\"><label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"project-filter\">项目</label><select id=\"project-filter\"><option value=\"\">全部项目</option></select><label class=\"search\">⌕ <input id=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索事项、提出者、完成者\" aria-label=\"搜索事项\"></label></div><div><button id=\"history\">变更记录</button> <button id=\"add-project\" hidden>＋ 新建项目</button> <button id=\"add-task\" class=\"primary\" hidden>＋ 添加事项</button></div></div><section id=\"points-panel\" class=\"points-panel\" hidden aria-label=\"积分账户\"></section><div id=\"board\" class=\"board\"></div><div class=\"board-foot\"><span>按项目折叠 · 新事项默认进入可开发池</span><span id=\"mode-hint\">当前为只读，可展开项目查看详情</span></div></section>\n<section id=\"points-view\" class=\"view\" hidden><div id=\"point-center\"></div></section>\n<section id=\"accounts-view\" class=\"view workspace-view\" hidden>\n<div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">公有账号 · 02</div><h2>我的授权账号</h2><p>只显示你有权使用的账号，复制时会重新核对权限。</p></div><span id=\"accounts-count\" class=\"count-badge\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"account-filters\"><label>所属项目<select id=\"account-project\"><option value=\"\">全部项目</option></select></label><label class=\"account-search\">搜索账号<input id=\"account-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"账号名称或项目名称\"></label></div>\n<div id=\"accounts\" class=\"account-grid\"></div></section>\n<section id=\"manage-view\" class=\"view workspace-view\" hidden>\n<section id=\"public-entry-panel\" class=\"management-panel\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><h3>普通访问入口</h3><p>链接本身不授予权限，访问成员功能需登录并验证身份。</p></div><button id=\"copy-public-entry\" type=\"button\">复制普通链接</button></div><label>普通访问链接<input id=\"public-entry-url\" type=\"url\" value=\"https://team-noticeboard-rebuilt.loneivy1.chatgpt.site/\" readonly aria-label=\"普通访问链接\"></label></section>\n<div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">权限管理 · 03</div><h2>账号与授权</h2><p>账号默认进入公共池；选择项目可管理对应用户和专属链接。</p></div><div class=\"section-actions\"><button id=\"add-user\">添加用户…</button><button id=\"add-account\" class=\"primary\">添加公有账号…</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"project-context\"><label>当前管理项目<select id=\"manage-repo\"></select></label><button id=\"edit-project\">编辑项目资料…</button><span id=\"manage-context\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"management-grid\"><aside class=\"management-panel\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3>默认账号池</h3><button id=\"select-all\">全选账号</button></div><p class=\"panel-hint\">勾选账号后拖入用户卡片，或点击该用户的“分配所选”。Shift 点击可连续选择。</p>\n<div class=\"management-toolbar\"><span id=\"selection-count\">已选 0 项</span><button id=\"grant-all\">分配给全部用户</button><button id=\"clear-all\">移除所选账号的全部授权</button><button id=\"delete-accounts\" class=\"danger\">删除所选账号</button></div><div id=\"pool\"></div></aside>\n<section class=\"management-panel\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3>用户与权限</h3><div class=\"section-actions\"><button id=\"select-users\">全选用户</button><button id=\"delete-users\" class=\"danger\">删除所选用户</button></div></div><p class=\"panel-hint\">一个账号可分配给多位用户；移除授权不会删除账号或用户。</p><div id=\"users\" class=\"user-grid\"></div></section></div>\n<section class=\"token-section management-panel\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><h2>专属访问链接</h2><p>访问链接即获得对应权限，无需输入链接。每条链接可单独调整权限或撤销。</p></div><div class=\"section-actions\"><button id=\"supervisor-link\" hidden>生成主管免登录链接</button><button id=\"issue-token\">配置新链接…</button></div></div><div id=\"tokens\"></div></section>\n<details class=\"storage-section\"><summary>数据同步与记录</summary><p id=\"storage-detail\"></p><button id=\"sync-github\" hidden>重试同步到 GitHub</button><button id=\"export-history\">导出公开历史</button><a href=\"/design.md\" download>下载设计细则</a><p id=\"identity-note\"></p></details></section>\n<footer><span>一起 / TEAM WORKSPACE</span><span>记录每一次推进。历史只增，不减。</span></footer></main>\n<dialog id=\"dialog\"><form id=\"form\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2 id=\"dialog-title\"></h2><button type=\"button\" id=\"close-dialog\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button></div><div id=\"fields\"></div><p id=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\"></p><div class=\"dialog-actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"cancel\">取消</button><button id=\"save\" class=\"primary\" type=\"submit\">保存</button></div></form></dialog>\n<div id=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></div><script>window.BOARD_CONFIG={\"frontendUrl\":\"https://team-noticeboard-rebuilt.loneivy1.chatgpt.site/\"};\nfunction installPointerDrag({allowed,selectAccount,drop,describe,acceptedTarget}){\n let active=null,suppressClickUntil=0;const animations=new WeakMap();\n function reset(){document.querySelectorAll('.drop-target').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('drop-target'));if(active?.frame)cancelAnimationFrame(active.frame)}\n function moveSlot(parent,before){const a=active;if(!a?.slot||a.slot.parentNode===parent&&a.slot.nextSibling===before)return;const selector=a.kind==='repo'?'.project-shell':'.task';const region=a.kind==='repo'?document.querySelector('#board'):a.source.closest('.project-shell');const nodes=[...(region||document).querySelectorAll(selector)].filter(n=>n!==a.source&&n!==a.ghost);const rects=new Map(nodes.map(n=>[n,n.getBoundingClientRect()]));parent.insertBefore(a.slot,before);for(const n of nodes){const old=rects.get(n);animations.get(n)?.cancel();const now=n.getBoundingClientRect(),dx=old.x-now.x,dy=old.y-now.y;if(Math.abs(dx)+Math.abs(dy)>1)animations.set(n,n.animate([{transform:`translate3d(${dx}px,${dy}px,0)`},{transform:'none'}],{duration:150,easing:'cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)'}))}}\n function targetAt(){const a=active;if(!a?.started)return;document.querySelectorAll('.drop-target').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('drop-target'));const under=document.elementFromPoint(a.x,a.y);if(a.slot&&under?.closest('.drop-slot')===a.slot)return;a.target=null;\n if(a.kind==='task'&&(under?.closest('[data-view=accepted]')||a.x>=window.innerWidth-32)){a.target=acceptedTarget(a.id);document.querySelector('[data-view=accepted]')?.classList.add('drop-target');return}\n if(a.kind==='task'){const body=under?.closest('.column-body');if(body&&body.dataset.repoId===a.source.dataset.repoId){const cards=[...body.querySelectorAll('article.task')].filter(n=>n!==a.source);let i=cards.findIndex(n=>a.y<n.getBoundingClientRect().top+n.getBoundingClientRect().height/2);if(i<0)i=cards.length;a.target={column:+body.dataset.column,order:cards.map(n=>n.dataset.id)};a.target.order.splice(i,0,a.id);a.dropElement=body;body.classList.add('drop-target');moveSlot(body,cards[i]||null)}}\n if(a.kind==='repo'){const project=under?.closest('.project-shell');if(project&&project!==a.source&&project.parentNode===a.originalParent){const after=a.y>project.getBoundingClientRect().top+project.getBoundingClientRect().height/2;a.target={repoId:project.dataset.repoId,after};a.dropElement=project;moveSlot(project.parentNode,after?project.nextSibling:project)}}\n if(a.kind==='account'){const user=under?.closest('.user-card');if(user){a.target={userId:user.dataset.user};a.dropElement=user;user.classList.add('drop-target')}}\n }\n function frame(){const a=active;if(!a?.started)return;const height=window.innerHeight;let scroll=0;if(a.y>height-75)scroll=Math.ceil((a.y-height+75)/4);else if(a.y<110)scroll=-Math.ceil((110-a.y)/4);if(scroll)window.scrollBy(0,Math.max(-22,Math.min(22,scroll)));if(a.dirty||scroll){a.ghost.style.transform=`translate3d(${a.x-a.offsetX}px,${a.y-a.offsetY}px,0)`;targetAt();a.dirty=false}a.frame=requestAnimationFrame(frame)}\n function begin(a){a.started=true;if(a.kind==='account')selectAccount(a.id);const r=a.source.getBoundingClientRect();a.offsetX=a.x-r.x;a.offsetY=a.y-r.y;a.originalParent=a.source.parentNode;a.originalNext=a.source.nextSibling;a.originalDisplay=a.source.style.display;const original=a.kind==='repo'?a.source.querySelector('.project-heading'):a.source;a.ghost=original.cloneNode(true);a.ghost.classList.add('drag-ghost');a.ghost.style.width=r.width+'px';a.ghost.style.margin='0';if(a.kind==='task'){a.ghost.style.padding=getComputedStyle(a.source).padding;a.ghost.style.height=r.height+'px'}a.ghost.querySelectorAll('[id]').forEach(n=>n.removeAttribute('id'));a.ghost.removeAttribute('id');if(a.kind==='account'){a.ghost.setAttribute('data-selection-label',describe(a));a.ghost.classList.add('account-drag-ghost')}document.body.append(a.ghost);a.source.classList.add('drag-source');if(a.kind!=='account'){a.slot=document.createElement('div');a.slot.className='drop-slot';a.slot.style.height=r.height+'px';a.slot.textContent='放在这里';a.originalParent.insertBefore(a.slot,a.source);a.source.style.display='none'}document.body.classList.add('is-dragging');document.documentElement.setPointerCapture?.(a.pointerId);window.getSelection()?.removeAllRanges();a.dirty=true;frame()}\n document.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.button!==0||active)return;const handle=e.target.closest('[data-drag-kind]');let kind=handle?.dataset.dragKind,source=handle?.closest('[data-drag-source]');if(!source){const task=e.target.closest('article.task[data-drag-source]'),account=e.target.closest('.pool-item[data-drag-source]'),heading=e.target.closest('.project-heading');if(task&&!e.target.closest('button,a,input,textarea,select')){source=task;kind='task'}else if(account&&!e.target.closest('button,input,a')){source=account;kind='account'}else if(heading&&!e.target.closest('a,input,textarea')&&(!e.target.closest('button')||e.target.closest('.project-toggle'))){source=heading.closest('.project-shell');kind='repo'}}if(!source||!allowed({dataset:{dragKind:kind,id:source.dataset.id||source.dataset.repoId}}))return;active={kind,id:handle?.dataset.id||source.dataset.id||source.dataset.account||source.dataset.repoId,source,pointerId:e.pointerId,x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,startX:e.clientX,startY:e.clientY,started:false,target:null,dirty:true}});\n document.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{const a=active;if(!a||a.pointerId!==e.pointerId)return;a.x=e.clientX;a.y=e.clientY;a.dirty=true;if(!a.started&&Math.hypot(a.x-a.startX,a.y-a.startY)>=5)begin(a);if(a.started)e.preventDefault()},{passive:false});\n async function finish(e,cancel=false){const a=active;if(!a||e.pointerId!==undefined&&e.pointerId!==a.pointerId)return;if(!a.started){active=null;return}targetAt();active=null;if(a.frame)cancelAnimationFrame(a.frame);suppressClickUntil=cancel?0:Date.now()+30;try{document.documentElement.releasePointerCapture?.(a.pointerId)}catch{}reset();let moved=false;if(!cancel&&a.target){if(a.kind!=='account'&&a.slot?.parentNode){const r=a.slot.getBoundingClientRect();try{await a.ghost.